    "单调性"
  ],
  "summary": "用同一正整数除数分别除数组元素并向上取整，求使总和不超过 threshold 的最小除数。",
  "insight": "除数增大时取整和单调不增；答案位于一到数组最大值，用二分查找首个满足和不超阈值的除数。",
  "pitfalls": [
    "向上取整可写为 (value+divisor-1)/divisor",
    "阈值至少为数组长度，最大值一定可行",
    "要找最左可行值"
  ],
  "solutions": [
    {
      "id": "binary-search-divisor",
      "title": "二分最小除数",
      "kind": "最优",
      "idea": "在单调可行区间上找左边界。",
      "steps": [
        "left=1,right=max(nums)",
        "middle=(left+right)/2，计算所有 ceil(value/middle) 之和",
        "若 sum<=threshold 则 right=middle，否则 left=middle+1，收敛后返回 left"
      ],
      "complexity": {
        "time": "O(n log maxValue)",
        "space": "O(1)"
      },
      "files": {
        "java": "solutions/binary-search-divisor/Solution.java",
        "kotlin": "solutions/binary-search-divisor/Solution.kt",
        "cpp": "solutions/binary-search-divisor/solution.cpp"
      }
    }
  ]
